NX system in every unit, controllable from a wall panel or phone app for lighting and temperature.</li><li>Premium Interiors - Natural-stone lift lobbies, wood-paneled corridors and marble finishes carrying through from entrance to front door.</li><li>Payment Plan - Discount options for buyers who settle their down payment in one shot or pay the full price at signing.</li><li>Limited Units - Just 47 residences across 5 floors, giving each home more privacy than a typical high-rise development.</li><li>Spacious Balconies - Included in every layout, extending living and dining space outdoors.</li><li>Prime Location - A well-connected address within Al Reeman, close to Shamkha Mall, the airport and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/yas-island/\">Yas Island.</a></li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2237,"cta":{"id":3070,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_aae1b0fd0d.jpg","hash":"Map_aae1b0fd0d","name":"Map.jpg"},"style":null,"title":null,"heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[{"id":176,"place_name":"Shamkha Mall","time_distance":"12 minutes"},{"id":177,"place_name":"Abu Dhabi International Airport","time_distance":"22 minutes"},{"id":178,"place_name":"Al Qana","time_distance":"25 minutes"},{"id":179,"place_name":"Grand Mosque","time_distance":"26 minutes"},{"id":180,"place_name":"Yas Island","time_distance":"28 minutes"},{"id":181,"place_name":"Louvre Abu Dhabi","time_distance":"35 minutes "}],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":null,"design_title":null},"brochure":null,"video_module":{"id":3792,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4984,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Studio_Apartment_22ea8